  {
   "text": "Noble is a creature type that represents creatures that belong to the aristocracy of their species , either by rank, title, or birth. In this, it is similar to the obsoleted Lord type.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "The subtype Noble was first featured on the card Faerie Noble from Homelands .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "History"
  },
  {
   "text": "In the Grand Creature Type Update the subtype was incorporated into the Faerie type. However, the type was reintroduced in Throne of Eldraine . Many cards depicting kings, queens or other aristocracy gained the type retroactively. Some additional cards like Crovax, Ascendant Hero gained in the next update.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "History"
  },
